      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Twitter Dual-Niche AI Influencer Workflow Template\nThis workflow runs a two-niche strategy designed for both outcomes: audience growth and monetization.\n\n### Niche Pair\n- Primary (Growth): Builder Mindset for Solopreneurs\n- Secondary (Monetization): AI Workflow Systems for business\n\n### Operating Model\n- Default split: 70% Builder content, 30% AI Workflow content\n- Builder posts drive reach, trust, and follower growth\n- AI Workflow posts drive buyer intent and monetization\n\n### Workflow Steps\n- Schedule or manually trigger posting\n- Configure dual-niche profile\n- Generate a post aligned to current content_mode\n- Validate length constraints\n- Publish to X\n\n### How to use\n1. Keep `content_mode` as `Builder (70%)` for 2 of 3 posts\n2. Switch to `AI Workflow (30%)` for every 3rd post\n3. Adjust style and inspiration based on what performs best\n4. Track saves, replies, and profile clicks to refine prompts\n",
        "height": 1145,
        "width": 689
      },
      "id": "86aef260-b0b4-495d-bae5-008d3b0288df",
